[statement]
A character device of numbers 8,262144 with a pax `SCHILY.devminor` record
of 262144 and none for the major, as bsdtar writes a device with a number of
262,144 or more. bsdtar reads its own record back with the major 0,
0,262144; GNU tar, Python and Go read 8,262144. ferrotape refuses it, at
both levels.

